# //content embedder without one does not degrade gracefully: chromium
# silently drops popups, auto-dismisses every JS dialog, ignores
# <input type=file> clicks, renders no context menu, and never honours
# requestFullscreen(). Each is a page that "just doesn't work" with no
# error anywhere.
